    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tm0u](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tm0u) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Aug 19 2026 25km NE of Ruteng. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -8.3926 longitude 120.529. It impacted 307615 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
